VUE_APP_TITLE=Xiaozhi Console
VUE_APP_DESCRIPTION=The Xiaozhi backend service (xiaozhi-server) is a backend service system for an intelligent terminal software and hardware ecosystem led by Professor Liu Siyuan's team at South China University of Technology. Built specifically for the xiaozhi-esp32 open-source hardware, it provides core capabilities such as multi-protocol compatibility, voice print recognition, and knowledge base management.
VUE_APP_KEYWORDS=xiaozhi-server, Xiaozhi server, Xiaozhi Console, AI hardware, smart hardware, AI toy, emotional companion, chatbot, smart home, in-vehicle robot
